-- ACTOR ---------------------- errors/cap_grant_24.march

`spawn` needs a plain actor name written directly, like `spawn(Counter)`. [spawn_computed_actor]
A computed actor expression (from an `if`, `match`, or function call) isn't supported: March resolves which actor to spawn at compile time from its name.

